---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const baseUrl = 'https://www.primeestores.pt';
const pageUrl = `${baseUrl}/en/privacy-policy/`;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Prime Estores"
  description="Privacy Policy of Prime Estores. Learn how we collect, use and protect your personal data in accordance with GDPR."
  keywords="privacy policy Prime Estores, GDPR, data protection, cookies"
  canonicalURL={pageUrl}
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A1A1A] to-[#8B1A1A] text-white py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/80">
          <li><a href="/en/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true"><span>/</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-white">Privacy Policy</span></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-white/80">How we collect, use and protect your personal data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: 1 January 2025</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        <strong>Prime Estores</strong> is a company specialising in the installation and repair of electric and manual blinds, based in Lisbon, Portugal. For privacy-related enquiries, please contact us:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@primeestores.pt" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">info@primeestores.pt</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+351923348323" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">+351 923 348 323</a></li>
        <li>Website: <a href="https://www.primeestores.pt" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">www.primeestores.pt</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">2. What data we collect</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We collect the following types of personal data:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> name, email address, phone number — when you fill in a quote or contact form.</li>
        <li><strong>Location data:</strong> address or geographic area — to provide the requested service.</li>
        <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited and visit duration — via cookies and analytics tools.</li>
        <li><strong>Communications:</strong> the content of messages sent through our forms or by email.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">3. How we use your data</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We use your data to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Respond to quote and contact requests;</li>
        <li>Provide the contracted services (blind installation and repair);</li>
        <li>Send information about service status or appointments;</li>
        <li>Improve our website and services through usage analysis;</li>
        <li>Comply with legal and tax obligations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">4. Legal basis for processing</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The processing of your personal data is based on: (a) performance of a contract or pre-contract, when you request a quote or service; (b) consent, for marketing communications; (c) legitimate interest, for website analysis and improvement; (d) legal obligation, for tax and accounting compliance.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">5. Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Our website uses cookies to improve your browsing experience and display relevant advertising. We use the following third-party services:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics (GA4):</strong> traffic and user behaviour analysis. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> display of personalised advertisements. Google may use cookies to personalise ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites. You can disable personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">google.com/settings/ads</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Maps / APIs:</strong> geographic location features.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings. Please note that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of the website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">6. Sharing data with third parties</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We do not sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes. Your data may be shared with:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Technology service providers (hosting, email) who process data on our behalf, under confidentiality agreements;</li>
        <li>Competent authorities, when required by law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">7. Data retention</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We retain your personal data for as long as necessary for the purposes for which it was collected: client data for the warranty period of services provided plus 5 years; contact data of potential clients for 12 months after the last contact; billing data for the legally required period (10 years).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">8. Your rights</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Under the GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation), you have the following rights:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Access:</strong> request a copy of the data we hold about you;</li>
        <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data;</li>
        <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> request the deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten");</li>
        <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> restrict the processing of your data in certain circumstances;</li>
        <li><strong>Portability:</strong> receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format;</li>
        <li><strong>Objection:</strong> object to processing based on legitimate interest or direct marketing.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        To exercise any of these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@primeestores.pt" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">info@primeestores.pt</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Portuguese supervisory authority: <a href="https://www.cnpd.pt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">CNPD — Comissão Nacional de Proteção de Dados</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">9. Data security</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your data against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure or destruction. Our website uses HTTPS to ensure encryption of communications.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">10. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. When we do, we update the date at the top of this page. We recommend that you review this policy regularly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-4 mt-8">11. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        For any questions about this Privacy Policy or about the processing of your personal data, please contact us:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-none text-gray-600 mb-6 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Prime Estores</strong></li>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@primeestores.pt" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">info@primeestores.pt</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+351923348323" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">+351 923 348 323</a></li>
        <li>Website: <a href="https://www.primeestores.pt" class="text-[#8B1A1A] hover:underline">www.primeestores.pt</a></li>
      </ul>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
